    "Back up one turn": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Revient un tour en arrière"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both restarts were launchd bringing it back after a crash in the Telegram adapter, at 14:02 and 17:45. The second log line says `RetryAfter: 29`; it hit a flood limit while editing a long draft. I've opened a fix on a branch: `fix/telegram-flood-wait`.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les deux redémarrages, à 14:02 et 17:45, viennent de launchd qui l’a relancée après un plantage de l’adaptateur Telegram. La deuxième ligne du journal dit `RetryAfter: 29` : elle a atteint une limite de débit en modifiant un long brouillon. J’ai ouvert un correctif sur une branche : `fix/telegram-flood-wait`."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can you check why the Hermes gateway restarted twice yesterday?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu peux regarder pourquoi la passerelle Hermes a redémarré deux fois hier ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change a rule": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Modifier une règle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't find @%@ on Telegram.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Impossible de trouver @%@ sur Telegram."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Dangerous command: restic forget --keep-within 90d --prune": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Commande dangereuse : restic forget --keep-within 90d --prune"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete backup snapshots older than 90 days to free about 212 GB on the external disk?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supprimer les instantanés de sauvegarde de plus de 90 jours pour libérer environ 212 Go sur le disque externe ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete the topic and its memory": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supprime le sujet et sa mémoire"
