        }
      }
    },
    "Every action but reads waits for your yes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toute action autre qu’une lecture attend ton accord."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find a quiet place to stay near Alfama, 3 nights from the 14th": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trouve un logement calme près d’Alfama, 3 nuits à partir du 14"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forget this sub-chat's key until unlocked": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oublie la clé de cette sous-discussion jusqu’au prochain déverrouillage"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Found 41 snapshots older than 90 days, the oldest from 12 March. Deleting them needs your go-ahead: once pruned, restic can't bring": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "J’ai trouvé 41 instantanés de plus de 90 jours, le plus ancien du 12 mars. Les supprimer demande ton accord : une fois élagués, restic ne pourra pas les"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Good morning! Three things overnight: the **nightly backup failed** at 03:12, Léa replied about Saturday, and your Lisbon flight is now boarding at gate 34 on Thursday.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bonjour ! Trois choses cette nuit : la **sauvegarde nocturne a échoué** à 03:12, Léa a répondu pour samedi, et ton vol pour Lisbonne embarque désormais porte 34 jeudi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Got it, I sent Léa the link with a note that it expires in 10 days.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bien reçu, j’ai envoyé le lien à Léa en précisant qu’il expire dans 10 jours."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Here's the video from Saturday for Léa": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voici la vidéo de samedi pour Léa"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermes asks to delete backups older than ninety days. Allow?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hermes demande à supprimer les sauvegardes de plus de quatre-vingt-dix jours. Tu autorises ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermes didn't answer in time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hermes n’a pas répondu à temps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hermes works on it across turns until reached": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hermes y travaille de tour en tour jusqu’à l’atteindre"
          }
        }
      }
    },
