            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce code n’est pas le bon. Vérifie-le et réessaie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That phone number doesn't look right.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce numéro de téléphone ne semble pas correct."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agents and tasks running now": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les agents et les tâches en cours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The external disk was full, so restic stopped before pruning:\n```\nFatal: unable to save snapshot: no space left on device\n```\nPruning snapshots older than 90 days would free about **212 GB**. Want me to do it?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le disque externe était plein, donc restic s’est arrêté avant le nettoyage :\n```\nFatal: unable to save snapshot: no space left on device\n```\nSupprimer les instantanés de plus de 90 jours libérerait environ **212 Go**. Je le fais ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
